{
  "name": "magpie-models-price",
  "version": "2.1.1",
  "description": "Magpie 模型价格与用量面板（页面插件 + 自带宿主部分）- 读取 models.dev 公价与本地用量按模型聚合展示；不注册供应商，页面保存的价格由插件自身的宿主部分自动写入 Magpie",
  "main": "index.js",
  "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
  "bin": {
    "magpie-models-price": "bin/magpie-models-price.js"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node bin/magpie-models-price.js ui",
    "list": "node bin/magpie-models-price.js list",
    "sync": "node bin/magpie-models-price.js sync",
    "apply": "node bin/magpie-models-price.js apply",
    "watch": "node bin/magpie-models-price.js watch",
    "test": "node check.js"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "magpie",
    "magpie-plugin",
    "magpie-page",
    "models.dev",
    "pricing",
    "llm-costs"
  ],
  "author": "zrtzrt",
  "license": "MIT",
  "magpie": {
    "name": "价格 (Models Price)",
    "title": "价格",
    "kind": "page",
    "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
    "summary": {
      "zh": "页面插件：按模型聚合展示 models.dev 公价、渠道价格与真实用量；页面里改的价格由插件自带的宿主部分自动写入 Magpie，无需再跑命令",
      "en": "Page plugin with its own host part: models.dev list prices and real usage grouped by model; a price saved in the page is applied to Magpie automatically"
    },
    "page": {
      "title": "价格",
      "titles": {
        "zh": "价格",
        "zh-CN": "价格",
        "zh-TW": "價格",
        "en": "Prices",
        "ja": "価格",
        "de": "Preise"
      },
      "file": "page/index.html",
      "icon": "page/icon.svg"
    },
    "permissions": [
      "usage:summary",
      "usage:day"
    ]
  },
  "files": [
    "bin/magpie-models-price.js",
    "apply-options.js",
    "matcher.js",
    "page-data.js",
    "server.js",
    "check.js",
    "public",
    "docs",
    "README.md",
    "page/index.html",
    "page/app.js",
    "page/i18n.js",
    "page/icons.js",
    "page/icon.svg",
    "page/style.css",
    "page/theme-boot.js",
    "page/icons",
    "index.js"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/zrtzrt/magpie-models-price.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/zrtzrt/magpie-models-price#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/zrtzrt/magpie-models-price/issues"
  },
  "kind": "page"
}
